# 15. LOGGING

Security tools should record what they did.

Example:

```python
import logging

logging.basicConfig(
    filename="assessment.log",
    level=logging.INFO,
    format="%(asctime)s %(levelname)s %(message)s"
)

logging.info("Assessment started")
```

Log:

- Start/end time
- Target
- Action
- Result
- Error
- Tool version

Never unnecessarily log:

- Passwords
- Tokens
- Session cookies
- Private keys

